WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:12.000
You're truly, truly dear.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:25.000
Life with it's sorrow, life with it's pain.

00:00:25.000 --> 00:01:08.000
I've been to war, I love you too.

00:01:08.000 --> 00:01:20.000
Ah, love is something to hold your time fast.

00:01:20.000 --> 00:01:32.000
Ah, yes, it's something by your side to stand.

00:01:32.000 --> 00:06:28.000
Dawn is so fine.

00:06:28.000 --> 00:06:40.000
I ask for this woman to be a bride to this man.

00:06:40.000 --> 00:06:46.000
Dearly beloved, we have gathered here in the space of this company in the presence of God

00:06:46.000 --> 00:06:52.000
to join together in holy matrimony this man and this woman

00:06:52.000 --> 00:06:56.000
which is honorable as declared by St. Paul among all men

00:06:56.000 --> 00:07:03.000
is therefore not by any to be entered into unadvisably or lightly

00:07:03.000 --> 00:07:10.000
but reverently, discreetly, advisably, soberly and in the fear of God

00:07:10.000 --> 00:07:14.000
into this holy state these two persons present come now to be joined

00:07:14.000 --> 00:07:18.000
if there is anyone here that can show a just cause

00:07:18.000 --> 00:07:23.000
while they should not be lawful joined in this holy matrimony

00:07:23.000 --> 00:07:30.000
let them now speak our forever holy peace

00:07:30.000 --> 00:07:33.000
I will require and will charge you both

00:07:33.000 --> 00:07:37.000
as you will surely answer at the day of judgment

00:07:37.000 --> 00:07:40.000
when the secrets of all hearts shall be disclosed

00:07:40.000 --> 00:07:43.000
that if either of you know any impediment

00:07:43.000 --> 00:07:46.000
why you should not be lawful joined together in this holy matrimony

00:07:46.000 --> 00:07:50.000
we now confess it for being assured unto you

00:07:50.000 --> 00:07:54.000
that any persons that are joined otherwise than God's word does allow

00:07:54.000 --> 00:07:57.000
their marriage is not lawful

00:07:57.000 --> 00:08:02.000
but believing that you have duly considered this solemn obligation

00:08:02.000 --> 00:08:04.000
that you are about to assume

00:08:04.000 --> 00:08:07.000
that you are prepared to enter upon the scene

00:08:07.000 --> 00:08:13.000
reverently, discreetly, wisely and in the fear of God

00:08:13.000 --> 00:08:16.000
I shall propose to you the marriage covenant

00:08:16.000 --> 00:08:23.000
you will declare the same as you join your right hand

00:08:23.000 --> 00:08:27.000
will you take this woman to be your lawful wedded wife

00:08:27.000 --> 00:08:29.000
to live together in this holy state of matrimony

00:08:29.000 --> 00:08:32.000
do you promise to love, honor and cherish

00:08:32.000 --> 00:08:35.000
in sickness and health, riches or poverty

00:08:35.000 --> 00:08:39.000
and will forsake all others and please be only unto her

00:08:39.000 --> 00:08:40.000
as long as you both live

00:08:40.000 --> 00:08:41.000
I will

00:08:41.000 --> 00:08:45.000
will you take this man to be your lawful wedded husband

00:08:45.000 --> 00:08:47.000
to live together in this holy matrimony

00:08:47.000 --> 00:08:51.000
do you promise to love, honor and cherish

00:08:51.000 --> 00:08:54.000
in sickness and health, riches or poverty

00:08:54.000 --> 00:08:58.000
and will forsake all others and please be only unto him

00:08:58.000 --> 00:09:00.000
as long as you both live

00:09:00.000 --> 00:09:01.000
I will

00:09:01.000 --> 00:09:03.000
I will require a token of you

00:09:03.000 --> 00:09:20.000
this covenant betwixt you and Sidney will always be kept

00:09:20.000 --> 00:09:24.000
now will you join your right hand together again

00:09:24.000 --> 00:09:27.000
upon the word of God

00:09:27.000 --> 00:09:31.000
as I am

00:09:31.000 --> 00:09:34.000
Almighty God

00:09:34.000 --> 00:09:39.000
who married the first man and woman

00:09:39.000 --> 00:09:42.000
in the garden of Eden

00:09:42.000 --> 00:09:46.000
joining together your own creation

00:09:46.000 --> 00:09:49.000
we do realize today

00:09:49.000 --> 00:09:53.000
that this commission has been carried out down through the ages

00:09:53.000 --> 00:09:58.000
until this very wedding

00:09:58.000 --> 00:15:08.000
Father...

00:15:08.000 --> 00:15:13.000
so let's move on over there
